---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`寵物血糖日記 App | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="專為糖尿病毛孩設計的免費血糖記錄工具，自動生成曲線圖，支援一鍵匯出給獸醫。" />
	</head>
	<body class="bg-[#FDFBF7] text-[#4A5568] font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col">
		<Header />
		<main class="flex-grow w-full">
			
			{/* Hero Section */}
			<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24 text-center">
				<div class="inline-block bg-[#FFF8F6] text-[#FF6F61] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold tracking-wider mb-6 border border-[#FFE8E3]">
					輕鬆記錄，掌握毛孩健康
				</div>
				<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 text-balance leading-tight">
					專為糖尿病毛孩設計的<br/><span class="text-[#A67C52]">專屬健康日記</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-500 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-balance">
					告別手寫紙本與凌亂的備忘錄。用最簡單的方式記錄毛孩的血糖與胰島素，自動生成趨勢圖表，並能一鍵產出完美的回診報告給獸醫。
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4 mb-16">
					<a href="https://mewsugar-tracker.pages.dev" target="_blank" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#A67C52] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#8C6239] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
						立即開啟使用 &rarr;
					</a>
				</div>
				
				{/* App Mockup Visual (This was missing!) */}
				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-[2rem] shadow-xl border border-gray-100 aspect-[16/9] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden relative">
					<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-gray-50 to-gray-100 opacity-50"></div>
					<div class="text-center z-10">
						<svg class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto text-gray-300 mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
						<p class="text-gray-400 font-bold text-lg">未來這裡會放上一張超美的 App 操作畫面截圖</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			{/* Problem & Solution */}
			<section class="bg-white py-16 border-y border-gray-100">
				<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
					<div class="text-center mb-12">
						<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">為什麼我們需要專屬的記錄工具？</h2>
						<p class="text-gray-500">照顧糖尿病寵物已經夠辛苦了，記錄不該成為你的另一個負擔。</p>
					</div>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
						<div class="bg-[#FFF8F6] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#FFE8E3]">
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#D9534F] mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 14l2-2m0 0l2-2m-2 2l-2-2m2 2l2 2m7-2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
								過去的痛點
							</h3>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
								<li>❌ 寫在紙本筆記本，回診時常忘記帶</li>
								<li>❌ 數值換算要一直切換手機計算機，手忙腳亂</li>
								<li>❌ 給獸醫看手機備忘錄，無法看出長期趨勢</li>
								<li>❌ 缺乏圖表輔助，難以抓到血糖異常的規律</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-[#F6F9F6] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#E8F0E8]">
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#7E9883] mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
								MewSugar 的解法
							</h3>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
								<li>✅ 手機隨時記，資料跟著走</li>
								<li>✅ 內建計算機，加減數值一次搞定</li>
								<li>✅ 自動繪製血糖曲線，健康趨勢一目了然</li>
								<li>✅ 一鍵匯出方便獸醫判讀的健康報表</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			{/* Features */}
			<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-16 text-center">專為糖尿病毛孩量身打造的三大特色</h2>
				
				<div class="space-y-16">
					{/* Feature 1 */}
					<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-16">
						<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 bg-gray-100 aspect-video rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center text-gray-300 font-bold shadow-inner">
							[自動生成血糖曲線圖示意圖]
						</div>
						<div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#FFF8F6] text-[#FF6F61] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 12l3-3 3 3 4-4M8 21l4-4 4 4M3 4h18M4 4h16v12a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V4z"></path></svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">自動生成血糖曲線圖</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
								再也不用看著密密麻麻的數字發愁！輸入數據後，系統會自動幫您畫出精美的「血糖曲線圖」。不管是飯後飆高還是半夜低血糖，健康趨勢一目了然，讓您與獸醫能更快抓到毛孩的血糖規律。
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					{/* Feature 2 */}
					<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-8 md:gap-16">
						<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 bg-gray-100 aspect-video rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center text-gray-300 font-bold shadow-inner">
							[內建計算機操作示意圖]
						</div>
						<div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#F8F5F0] text-[#A67C52] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">內建數值計算機</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
								使用人類血糖機測量時，不用再手忙腳亂地切換計算機。我們直接在輸入框內建了手動計算功能，測到什麼數字，直接在原地完成計算，省時又防呆。
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					{/* Feature 3 */}
					<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-16">
						<div class="w-full md:w-1/2 bg-gray-100 aspect-video rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center text-gray-300 font-bold shadow-inner">
							[匯出報表示意圖]
						</div>
						<div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#F6F9F6] text-[#7E9883] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">醫病溝通零障礙</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
								獸醫師最怕看到凌亂的紙本或截圖。我們的系統支援「一鍵匯出完整健康報表」，將您的紀錄轉換為最整齊的專業格式，讓獸醫師能快速判讀，做出精準的醫療決策。
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

				</div>
			</section>

			{/* Final CTA */}
			<section class="bg-[#F8F5F0] py-20 mt-12 border-t border-[#EAE4D9]">
				<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">準備好開始記錄了嗎？</h2>
					<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-10">把複雜的數據交給我們，把更多的時間留給毛孩。</p>
					<a href="https://mewsugar-tracker.pages.dev" target="_blank" class="inline-block bg-[#A67C52] text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#8C6239] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
						立刻前往體驗 App &rarr;
					</a>
				</div>
			</section>

		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
